DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T143000
UID:10002097-1784457000-1784471400@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:The world’s biggest sporting event comes to an unforgettable
  finish! Join the Davis community for the 2026 FIFA World Cup Final as 
 Davis Soccer Fest wraps up its Community Pre-Game Party Series with one l
 ast celebration. \n🗓 Sunday\, July 19\, 2026⏰ Pre-Game Party: 10:30
  AM⚽ Kickoff: 12:00 PM📍 G Street & 3rd Street\, Downtown Davis🎟
  Free & Open to All \nGather with fellow soccer fans to experience the ex
 citement of the World Cup Final on the big screen while enjoying a festi
 ve morning downtown! \nEvent Highlights\n🎯 Soccer darts🎲 Prize wheel
  giveaways🎵 Live DJ on G Street🏆 Raffle prizes & special giveaways
 ⚽ Community watch party🍕 Food and drinks from Downtown Davis business
 es \nWhether you’ve followed every match or are just joining the excitem
 ent for the championship\, this is the perfect way to celebrate the conclu
 sion of an incredible World Cup with friends\, family\, and fellow fans. \
 nA special thank you to our sponsors:\n⭐ Astound Broadband – Signatur
 e Sponsor🍕 Woodstock’s Pizza🍺 Three Mile Brewing Co.🍜 Sophia’
 s Thai Kitchen \nAnd our community partners:\n🚲 Davis Downtown Business
  Association🏛 Davis Chamber of Commerce⚽ Davis Community Soccer🛡 D
 avis Legacy Soccer Club \nDon’t miss the final match of the tournament a
 nd the grand finale of Davis Soccer Fest. We’ll see you on G Street for 
 one last celebration!
