 ence Gallery canvas tote. Each participant will receive a tote bag that fe
 atures the Pence building and logo. This workshop is open to ages 12 and u
 p and is perfect for beginners\; no prior embroidery experience is necessa
 ry.\n\nTote Embroidery Workshop\nSunday\, August 30\, 1-4 PM\n$25 Members\
 , $40 Non-Members (All materials included)\n\n**Registration is required t
 hrough the [Pence's website (CLICK HERE)](https://pencegallery.org/educati
 on/programs/workshops-and-classes/).**\n\nAny questions? Email pencegaller
